WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.708
Smile!

00:00:00.708 --> 00:00:02.083
For even in elimination

00:00:02.083 --> 00:00:03.833
you have become children of Brady!

00:00:03.833 --> 00:00:05.666
We have a 25-point lead.

00:00:06.541 --> 00:00:07.458
Huh, I feel like people are

00:00:07.458 --> 00:00:08.791
never going to let me get over this.

00:00:08.791 --> 00:00:09.375
One more

00:00:09.375 --> 00:00:11.458
and I’ll have just as many as the Steelers!

00:00:14.125 --> 00:00:15.291
Thomas is coming.

00:00:15.291 --> 00:00:17.083
You all in the AFC need to stop him.

00:00:17.083 --> 00:00:17.916
If he wins again

00:00:17.916 --> 00:00:19.583
it will be boring on a scale

00:00:19.583 --> 00:00:21.000
this league has never seen.

00:00:21.041 --> 00:00:22.166
Prepare the offense

00:00:22.166 --> 00:00:23.291
engage all defenses

00:00:23.291 --> 00:00:24.333
and get this man a coach

00:00:24.333 --> 00:00:26.000
who can maximize his serviceable talent!

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.166
Hey, I’m a computer man.

00:00:27.166 --> 00:00:27.958
Something’s wrong.

00:00:27.958 --> 00:00:29.208
St. Louis is deserted.

00:00:29.208 --> 00:00:30.625
All that’s left is baseball

00:00:30.625 --> 00:00:31.708
and a Six Flags.

00:00:31.708 --> 00:00:33.000
STAN KROENKE?!

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.333
WE HAD TO LEAVE ST. LOUIS!

00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:35.750
IT’S A SMALL MARKET TOWN!

00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:37.125
I need you to pay me.

00:00:37.125 --> 00:00:38.916
It’s the only way to stop Brady.

00:00:38.916 --> 00:00:39.916
It can’t be done!

00:00:39.916 --> 00:00:40.958
You play defense!

00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:41.666
RPO.

00:00:41.666 --> 00:00:42.291
Is he OK?

00:00:42.291 --> 00:00:43.291
OH, THAT’S JUST COACH

00:00:43.291 --> 00:00:44.250
TRYING TO GAME PLAN.

00:00:44.458 --> 00:00:45.958
Fun teams in the AFC?

00:00:45.958 --> 00:00:48.166
I will restore order to the universe.

00:00:48.291 --> 00:00:49.458
I’M GOING TO TAKE DOWN THE GOAT!

00:00:49.458 --> 00:00:50.333
It’s working!

00:00:50.333 --> 00:00:51.625
I see so many articles about how this

00:00:51.625 --> 00:00:53.291
could be the end of the Patriots dynasty.

00:00:53.291 --> 00:00:54.291
AH, FUDGING BRADY

00:00:54.291 --> 00:00:56.041
STOPPING ME FROM BEING A G.D. H.O.F.-ER.

00:00:56.041 --> 00:00:57.291
CALM DOWN, PHIL!

00:00:57.291 --> 00:00:57.625
FUDGE.

00:00:57.625 --> 00:00:58.625
In my experience

00:00:58.625 --> 00:00:59.958
giving him back the ball is bad.

00:00:59.958 --> 00:01:01.000
Jeez, we get it.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:02.250
Oh hey, look—I got us to overtime!

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:03.041
Overtime rules.

00:01:03.041 --> 00:01:04.041
Tom gets to punch first.

00:01:04.041 --> 00:01:05.583
If he misses, Patrick gets to punch.

00:01:05.583 --> 00:01:07.041
WAIT, I MIGHT NOT GET TO PLAY?!?!

00:01:07.375 --> 00:01:09.000
Great competitor. Hell of a game.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:10.666
We’re at the end of the game now!

00:01:10.666 --> 00:01:12.083
The Rams are our last chance.

00:01:12.083 --> 00:01:13.958
Me and the Rams had a bit of a falling out...

00:01:13.958 --> 00:01:15.916
NO, I SHOULD WIN.

00:01:16.666 --> 00:01:18.250
Oh, sorry! I didn’t see that.

00:01:18.250 --> 00:01:19.333
STOP HOLDING OUT!

00:01:19.333 --> 00:01:20.583
YOU’RE HURTING YOURSELF!

00:01:20.583 --> 00:01:21.250
AHHHHHHHHH!

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:21.791
OK, Todd

00:01:21.791 --> 00:01:23.041
now may be a good time to unleash

00:01:23.041 --> 00:01:24.000
THE GURLEY!

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:24.666
AHHHHHHHHH!

00:01:24.666 --> 00:01:25.125
Yo, something weird

00:01:25.125 --> 00:01:26.125
is going on with me right now.

00:01:26.125 --> 00:01:27.125
What are they?

00:01:27.125 --> 00:01:28.541
White no-name position players.

00:01:28.541 --> 00:01:29.458
Totally expendable.

00:01:29.458 --> 00:01:30.250
ATTACK!

00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:31.625
THIS OLD THING STILL WORKS!

00:01:31.875 --> 00:01:32.708
HALLE BERRY!

00:01:32.708 --> 00:01:33.875
I don’t even know who you are.

00:01:33.875 --> 00:01:35.208
Jared’s a system quarterback

00:01:35.208 --> 00:01:36.291
JUST LIKE YOU!

00:01:36.291 --> 00:01:37.375
NOT TRUE!

00:01:39.875 --> 00:01:42.000
You shouldn’t have gone for my head.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:42.416
No!

00:01:42.416 --> 00:01:43.583
Roughing the passer!

00:01:43.791 --> 00:01:44.458
Oh fun!

00:01:44.458 --> 00:01:45.541
A new setback!

00:01:45.541 --> 00:01:46.541
I am Lamar!

00:01:46.541 --> 00:01:47.000
I am…

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:47.791
AH, FLUFF-

00:01:47.791 --> 00:01:49.291
Hell yeah, I get to disappear again!

00:01:49.291 --> 00:01:50.083
MR. BREES

00:01:50.083 --> 00:01:52.000
I DON’T FEEL SO GOOD.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:52.625
I blame the refs

00:01:52.625 --> 00:01:54.083
and I refuse to accept this reality.

00:01:54.208 --> 00:01:55.791
OK, so that’s one of the 14 million ways

00:01:55.791 --> 00:01:56.541
this could go down.

00:01:56.541 --> 00:01:57.375
Let’s practice it again!

00:01:57.416 --> 00:01:58.166
Ugh.

00:01:58.541 --> 00:01:59.958
Thanos didn’t go far enough.

